Package: gooogleplus
Type: Package
Title: A package to fit group regularised models to zero-inflated count data.
Version: 1.0
Date: 2025-04-10
Author: Simon Ciavarro
Maintainer: Simon Ciavarro <gbsimone@outlook.com>
Description: This package uses group coordinate descent to perform group variable selection on regression models for zero-inflated count data and returns a fitted model.
